window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/c455-c5b5c2392e2dd495.json"]={sha256:"c5b5c2392e2dd49599475ed86976982bce4796e9f3899061353c56ea82c1d9c9",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v24-case-d1cd3379753d21f6","url":"https://quintustechnologies.com/products/material-densification/hot-isostatic-presses/","title":"Quintus Hot Isostatic Presses","titleEn":"Quintus Hot Isostatic Presses","publisher":"Quintus Technologies","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"c455","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"c455","related":[{"id":"c456","referenceUrls":["https://www.mpif.org/"],"title":"金屬射出成形","titleEn":"Metal injection molding","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：兩種量測各有不確定度，孔隙改善可量化，且明確未取代材料機械性能驗證。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Quantify uncertainties of both methods and porosity improvement while explicitly retaining mechanical-property validation.","difference":"把金屬質量分率與體積分率分清，從配料帳推算燒結成品的理想體積。","differenceEn":"Separate metal mass fraction from volume fraction and infer ideal sintered volume from the feedstock ledger.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["以實體材料密度為基準，相對密度=1−孔隙體積率；相同金屬質量下尺寸變化須由體積比推導。 教學試片前後孔隙率為 2.0% 與 0.2%，初始體積 100 cm³，假設金屬質量不變。 Vafter=100×0.98/0.998=98.1964 cm³；體積下降 1.8036%，不能直接當成線收縮。","各成分體積為質量除密度；混合物密度不能以質量分率線性平均材料密度。 合成 100 g 配料含金屬 90 g、黏結劑 10 g，密度分別 7.5 與 1.0 g/cm³，忽略混合空隙。 Vmetal=90/7.5=12 cm³，Vbinder=10 cm³；金屬體積分率 12/22=54.545%，混合密度 100/22=4.545 g/cm³。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Relative density equals one minus void fraction on a solid-material basis; fixed-mass size change follows the volume ratio. Teaching porosity is 2.0% before and 0.2% after; initial volume 100 cm³ with unchanged metal mass. Vafter=100×0.98/0.998=98.1964 cm³; volume decreases 1.8036%, which is not the linear contraction.","Component volume equals mass divided by density; mixture density is not a mass-weighted arithmetic mean of constituent densities. Synthetic 100 g feedstock contains 90 g metal and 10 g binder with densities 7.5 and 1.0 g/cm³; neglect mixing voids. Metal volume=12 cm³ and binder volume=10 cm³; metal volume fraction=12/22=54.545%, mixture density=100/22=4.545 g/cm³.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"c465","referenceUrls":["https://www.gleason.com/en/products/tools/cylindrical/hobbing-and-milling/carbide-tools"],"title":"齒輪滾齒與剃齒","titleEn":"Gear hobbing and shaving","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：兩種量測各有不確定度，孔隙改善可量化，且明確未取代材料機械性能驗證。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Quantify uncertainties of both methods and porosity improvement while explicitly retaining mechanical-property validation.","difference":"把模數、齒數與節圓關係算清，區分滾齒生成幾何與剃齒修整。","differenceEn":"Calculate module, tooth count and pitch diameter, distinguishing generated geometry from shaving refinement.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["以實體材料密度為基準，相對密度=1−孔隙體積率；相同金屬質量下尺寸變化須由體積比推導。 教學試片前後孔隙率為 2.0% 與 0.2%，初始體積 100 cm³，假設金屬質量不變。 Vafter=100×0.98/0.998=98.1964 cm³；體積下降 1.8036%，不能直接當成線收縮。","直齒輪節圓 d=mz，圓周節距 p=πm；節圓不是可直接卡尺量到的齒頂圓。 教學直齒輪模數 2 mm、齒數 30；標準未變位齒頂高暫取 1m。 節圓 d=60 mm，節距 p=6.28319 mm，齒頂圓 da=m(z+2)=64 mm。變位或非標準齒不適用最後一式。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Relative density equals one minus void fraction on a solid-material basis; fixed-mass size change follows the volume ratio. Teaching porosity is 2.0% before and 0.2% after; initial volume 100 cm³ with unchanged metal mass. Vafter=100×0.98/0.998=98.1964 cm³; volume decreases 1.8036%, which is not the linear contraction.","For a spur gear d=mz and circular pitch p=πm; pitch circle is not the directly measurable outside circle. Teaching spur gear module 2 mm and 30 teeth; assume unshifted standard addendum 1 m. Pitch diameter 60 mm, circular pitch 6.28319 mm and OD=m(z+2)=64 mm; the last expression excludes profile shift/nonstandard teeth.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v24-case-cbb1d8ac0fc20ab4","url":"https://www.mpif.org/","title":"Powder Metallurgy Processes","titleEn":"Powder Metallurgy Processes","publisher":"Metal Powder Industries Federation","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v24-case-28cfb2bb97f1952a","url":"https://www.gleason.com/en/products/tools/cylindrical/hobbing-and-milling/carbide-tools","title":"Gleason Carbide Hobs and Milling Tools","titleEn":"Gleason Carbide Hobs and Milling Tools","publisher":"Gleason","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
